Measured 2026-08-08, json c=16, 320 requests: jsonlog dir 128.1 req/s, jsonlog file 130.7, no usage store at all 129.8. All within noise.

Recorded so nobody spends a sprint moving usage writes off the request path. If that idea comes up again, this is the answer. Re-measure only if the store changes (a DBI backend on a real PostgreSQL is a different question and has not been measured).
